    'register.policy.privacy1.title': '1. Information We Collect',
    'register.policy.privacy1.desc': 'When you register and use the Academic Research Sharing (ARS), we collect the following types of information:',
    'register.policy.privacy1.l1.strong': 'Tài khoản Identity:',
    'register.policy.privacy1.l1.text': 'Full Tên, Email Address, Contact Phone Number, and Password.',
    'register.policy.privacy1.l2.strong': 'Academic Credentials:',
    'register.policy.privacy1.l2.text': 'Selected Platform Vai trò (Nhà nghiên cứu, Người phản biện, Giảng viên, Graduate Sinh viên), Affiliated University/Institution, and ORCID identifier.',
    'register.policy.privacy1.l3.strong': 'Verification Documents:',
    'register.policy.privacy1.l3.text': 'Academic portfolio PDFs, student enrollment certificates, or proof of faculty appointment uploaded for identity verification.',
    'register.policy.privacy2.title': '2. How We Use Your Data',
    'register.policy.privacy2.desc': 'Your data is strictly used for the following platform purposes:',
    'register.policy.privacy2.l1': 'Verifying academic authenticity and approving requested business roles.',
    'register.policy.privacy2.l2': 'Facilitating blind peer review assignments based on verified scholarly expertise.',
    'register.policy.privacy2.l3': 'Sending critical notifications regarding paper reviews, milestone evaluations, and account updates.',
    'register.policy.privacy2.l4': 'Securing academic research assets and preventing fraudulent submissions.',
    'register.policy.privacy3.title': '3. Storage & Document Security',
    'register.policy.privacy3.desc': 'All uploaded verification PDFs and sensitive manuscripts are stored in encrypted cloud storage (Firebase Cloud Storage & Azure Secure Blobs). Only verified Platform Administrators have restricted access to inspect verification proofs during account review.',
    'register.policy.privacy4.title': '4. Người dùng Rights & Data Protection',
    'register.policy.privacy4.desc': 'You have the right to review, update, or request the deletion of your personal account data at any time through Tài khoản Settings or by contacting ARS Platform Administration.',
    'register.policy.terms1.title': '1. Academic Integrity & Ethics',
    'register.policy.terms1.desc': 'By creating an account on ARS, you agree to adhere to standard international scientific ethics:',
    'register.policy.terms1.l1': 'All submitted research, evaluation reports, and seminar materials must be original and free of plagiarism.',
    'register.policy.terms1.l2': 'Falsification of academic affiliations, credentials, or ORCID identity is grounds for immediate account termination.',
    'register.policy.terms2.title': '2. Platform Roles & Responsibilities',
    'register.policy.terms2.l1.strong': 'Nhà nghiên cứu:',
    'register.policy.terms2.l1.text': 'Responsible for accurate metadata, citation integrity, and ethical preprint distribution.',
    'register.policy.terms2.l2.strong': 'Người phản biện:',
    'register.policy.terms2.l2.text': 'Bound by strict confidentiality. Manuscript contents must not be shared, duplicated, or utilized prior to formal publication.',
    'register.policy.terms2.l3.strong': 'Giảng viên & Graduate Sinh viên:',
    'register.policy.terms2.l3.text': 'Obligated to maintain authentic milestone reports, supervision logs, and seminar materials.',
    'register.policy.terms3.title': '3. Tài khoản Verification & Trạng thái',
    'register.policy.terms3.desc': 'Newly created accounts start in a Đang chờ verification state. You will have guest access to community forums until an Administrator verifies your credentials and approves your designated role.',
    'register.policy.terms4.title': '4. Termination & Policy Updates',
    'register.policy.terms4.desc': 'ARS reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that breach peer review confidentiality, post abusive content, or violate academic research standards.',
    'register.policy.agree': 'I Understand & Agree',
